+    """Escalate a proven cause whose settlement still leaves money unexplained.
+
+    ``residual`` is money the fee/tax correction does not account for against
+    what was actually paid. ``arithmetic_gap`` is the settlement contradicting
+    its own figures: its reported net differs from gross, fees, tax and refunds.
+    Either one alone is enough to block closure.
